    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292">

                <pb facs="0399" n="279" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg279"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the Bureau of Accounts to the Cuban
                        Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic">April 6,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: By direction of the Acting Secretary of
                    State I have the honor to refer you to the memorandum of the Department of the
                    17th of January last, and to your reply of the 29th ultimo, in connection with
                    the claim of Luciano Arestuche, and to inclose herewith a receipt for $500 in
                    full payment of the same, together with my check for the said amount.</p>
                <p>I will thank you to sign the receipt and return it to me.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas Morrison.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
